## 21.2 Organization Structure Reference

Struktur organisasi ERP dirancang berjenjang tanpa batas level (*unlimited level*), dikonfigurasi melalui modul Organization Management sebagaimana dijabarkan pada **BAB 9 Business Requirement — 9.1 Organization Management Requirements (BR-001 s/d BR-010)**.

Contoh ilustrasi struktur organisasi target:

```text
Holding Company (PT ABC Group)
│
├── Sub Holding (Agribusiness Division)
│   │
│   ├── Company (PT ABC Plantation)
│   │   ├── Business Unit (Estate Operation)
│   │   │   ├── Branch (Regional Office - Sumatra)
│   │   │   │   ├── Department (Finance & Accounting)
│   │   │   │   ├── Department (Human Resources)
│   │   │   │   └── Warehouse (Central Warehouse - Sumatra)
│   │   │   └── Project Site (New Plantation Development Site)
│   │   └── Business Unit (Processing Mill)
│   │       ├── Department (Production)
│   │       └── Warehouse (Finished Goods Warehouse)
│   │
│   └── Company (PT ABC Trading)
│       ├── Branch (Jakarta Branch)
│       └── Branch (Surabaya Branch)
│
└── Sub Holding (Manufacturing Division)
    │
    └── Company (PT ABC Manufacturing)
        ├── Business Unit (Plant 1)
        ├── Business Unit (Plant 2)
        └── Department (Corporate Shared Service)
```

Catatan atas diagram:

* Level organisasi bersifat konfiguratif; contoh di atas hanya menggambarkan salah satu kemungkinan konfigurasi (BRule-ORG-001).
* Setiap unit organisasi memiliki hubungan Parent–Child yang membentuk Organization Tree (BR-003) dan wajib memiliki Organization Code unik (BR-005).
* Organization Scope pada setiap level menjadi dasar pengendalian akses, workflow, dan konsolidasi pelaporan lintas Holding, Sub Holding, dan Company (BR-007).
* Rujukan lengkap kebutuhan bisnis terkait struktur organisasi tersedia pada **BAB 9.1 Organization Management Requirements, BR-001 sampai dengan BR-010**.

